"credit":"Myself","detail":"<p>I&#8217;m Christian MacMillan, I was born in Mallorca in 1990 and have always been fascinated by design and tech. I studied a BS in Software Engineering, but soon I realized I was drawn towards more creative ways of implementing software. Three years ago, after living in different cities and working in some of the most creative and recongnized agencies, like B-Reel or Vasava, I decided to go solo. After years of freelancing, I grow into a full-service development studio to meet with my clients needs. We are a remote team designed to scale on a project basis. Easygoing, open minded, easy to collaborate with, and always willing to learn new skills in different areas.</p>\n","clients":{"title":"Featured Clients","hint":"& More","list":[{"ID":178,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2024-09-09 12:08:45","post_date_gmt":"2024-09-09 12:08:45","post_content":"","post_title":"Ambia","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"ambia","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"2024-09-09 12:09:26","post_modified_gmt":"2024-09-09 12:09:26","post_content_filtered":"","post_parent":0,"guid":"https://ms-cms.com/?post_type=client&#038;p=178","menu_order":0,"post_type":"client","post_mime_type":"","comment_count":"0","filter":"raw"},{"ID":179,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2024-09-09 12:09:41","post_date_gmt":"2024-09-09 12:09:41","post_content":"","post_title":"B-Reel","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"b-reel","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"2024-09-09 12:09:41","post_modified_gmt":"2024-09-09 12:09:41","post_content_filtered":"","post_parent":0,"guid":"https://ms-cms.com/?post_type=client&#038;p=179","menu_order":0,"post_type":"client","post_mime_type":"","comment_count":"0","filter":"raw"},{"ID":200,"post_author":"1","post_date":"2024-09-09 12:15:32","post_date_gmt":"2024-09-09 12